    "title": "Local man faces animal cruelty charge - NewsBreak",
    "text": "MARATHON — A 48-year-old local man was arrested Monday, July 28, for allegedly dragging, throwing, kicking and injuring a Chihuahua dog. Benjamin Franklin Cook was charged with animal cruelty and disorderly intoxication, according to the Monroe County Sheriff's Office. Deputies responded to reports of animal abuse on 107th Street and First Avenue at approximately 10:45 a.m. Multiple witnesses reported observing Cook physically abuse the dog, reports say. The dog suffered injuries to his face and throat that required veterinarian care. Cook was taken to jail.",
